DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44160::$$$message_0378_0000_0000$$$::"The seven stars are together at last.[lr]::
44161::$$$message_0378_0000_0001$$$::When the seven north stars are assembled, the seven sages shall revive the ancient sealed evil..."::
44162::$$$message_0378_0001_0000$$$::"But know this, beloved Gym Shorts. Thy foe stands beside thee. TAIGA MUST DIE. TAIGA MUST DIE![nolr] The thorns of war yet flourish...!"::
44163::$$$message_0378_0002_0000$$$::"Ahhh, why do humans betray each other?[lr]::
44164::$$$message_0378_0002_0001$$$::[movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=2000 accel=0 storage=hf_ぞうけんくん星]How tragic. Why can't we live [se storage=se452.wav]pure and noble lives?"::
44165::$$$message_0378_0003_0000$$$::"So it's the hills all the way in the back.[lr]::
44166::$$$message_0378_0003_0001$$$::We're almost there, Taiga. Now we can grant our... [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=うーん layer=1 time=200][say storage=HSTR8_BIR_0030 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Taiga?"::
44167::$$$message_0378_0004_0000$$$::"...[hfchance layer=0]Hmph. This farce is over."::
44168::$$$message_0378_0005_0000$$$::"Illya, it's time to stop pretending to be friends. Give me all the stars if you want to live."::
44169::$$$message_0378_0005_0001$$$::"Huh...? [l][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=哀2 layer=1 time=200][say storage=HSTR8_BIR_0060 _name=ブルマイリヤ]W-what is this, some new bit?[lr]::
44170::$$$message_0378_0005_0002$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=楽3 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1]You gotta do better, Taiga. That wasn't funny[line len=2]"::
44171::$$$message_0378_0006_0000$$$::"Ah...!?"::
44172::$$$message_0378_0006_0001$$$::"You're a joke, Illya. Honestly, how long do you plan on acting like a Master?"::
44173::$$$message_0378_0006_0002$$$::"You've already used all of your Command Spells that were binding me."::
44174::$$$message_0378_0006_0003$$$::"Huh...? No way.[lr]::
44175::$$$message_0378_0006_0004$$$::Y-[l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR8_BIR_0130 _name=ブルマイリヤ]you're kidding, right, Taiga...?"::
44176::$$$message_0378_0007_0000$$$::"We've fought together this entire time, and became master and apprentice..."::
44177::$$$message_0378_0007_0001$$$::"Kek kek kek kek.[lr]::
44178::$$$message_0378_0007_0002$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=真剣 layer=0 time=200]You're naïve. So naïve, little lady. That explains how you got kicked out of your old world."::
44179::$$$message_0378_0007_0003$$$::"I'm the only one who's getting her wish granted. It's been a single winner-takes-all from the beginning."::
44180::$$$message_0378_0007_0004$$$::"No... I can't believe you're going to betray me[l][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=哀 layer=1 time=200][say storage=HSTR8_BIR_0170 _name=ブルマイリヤ] at the very end, Taiga..."::
44181::$$$message_0378_0007_0005$$$::"Heh heh heh. Ah, sweet despair."::
44182::$$$message_0378_0008_0000$$$::"You've lost the will to fight, so I'll take my time hurting[line len=2]"::
44183::$$$message_0378_0008_0001$$$::"I expected this from the very start."[nolr][p]::
44184::$$$message_0378_0008_0002$$$::"Huh? Is something burning? Like during the final showdown of [font italic=true]Fate/stay night[font italic=false]?"::
44185::$$$message_0378_0008_0003$$$::"Heh. I set up a Bounded Field when we came to Ryudou Temple, thinking this might happen."::
44186::$$$message_0378_0008_0004$$$::"I had a hunch that some misguided soul would try to backstab me at the last minute!"::
44187::$$$message_0378_0008_0005$$$::"...(Aw, crap.)[lr]::
44188::$$$message_0378_0008_0006$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=楽2 layer=0 time=200][hfpop layer=0]Umm, Illya? Can we say we were just kidding after all?"::
44189::$$$message_0378_0008_0007$$$::"No! I'm the idiot for thinking a little better of you and changing my plans!"::
44190::$$$message_0378_0009_0000$$$::"[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=ふっ layer=1 time=200][hfwww layer=1]The very first thing I planned was to beat you black and blue, and I'm going to make good on that!"::
44191::$$$message_0378_0009_0001$$$::"...Heh. I knew we were two peas in a pod as Servant and Master, but you're even more like me than I thought."::
44192::$$$message_0378_0009_0002$$$::"Count me in. I'll smack some sense into your rotten core!"::
44193::$$$message_0378_0009_0003$$$::"That's my line! Let's do this, Taigaaaa!"::
44194::$$$message_0378_0009_0004$$$::"Waaaah! I know you're all fired up, but don't stretch my name out like that!"[nolr][p]::

